{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/sa71acy6bfipt9pkjj6pjnczay0xbw8.mp3","text":"“需要交给稀音小姐的任务，请直接让镜头来代劳吧。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/iimy941e0jk1pymdu72la316l8a9sfv.mp3","text":"“稀音小姐是各大摄影比赛自然和静物组的双料冠军，如果有人愿意等，拿肖像组冠军的概率也会大幅增加。博士你来当稀音小姐的模特好不好？”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/8f/4u6k8wt2woqez8ainbhg3xl4hgrt82e.mp3","text":"“检测到博士的耐心正在消逝，开始运行安慰程序——距离稀音小姐完成拍摄还剩不足半小时，请再坚持一下。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/4z8b2ncmpowz7c6ccm2fiv3ocir8ed5.mp3","text":"“隔壁的札拉克又来找稀音小姐了，虽然小姐还没笑出来，但我知道她很开心。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d2/2csp8wbuxmhgurk9r5ud84o1amb7v7v.mp3","text":"“其实稀音小姐原本要给哥伦比亚的摄影器材巨头当专职摄影师的，不知怎么就来您这里当干员了。据镜头推测可能是因为对方让她拍的东西，她不喜欢。是的，稀音小姐就是这么挑剔。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/ab/1qboqng5ry1fkpv407pctf6snjqwfgx.mp3","text":"看到喜欢的，就要拍下，存起来。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/7s3vyq0lsh0mf4zprlis54cpiicz9ub.mp3","text":"“博士你又想逗稀音小姐笑吗？其实她已经笑了，虽然想看到笑容需要等，再等，继续等，一直等到嘴角的弧度变得完美为止。这个过程会耗时——不知道几分钟，全看小姐今天心情如何。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/38fm2546pg0b1r0um1hja57e1rjtmx6.mp3","text":"“镜头一直在等一个能够理解稀音小姐的人，但现在罗德岛内有许多人都愿意来接触她，镜头感到了快乐，希望有一天小姐能真正找到完美替代镜头的生物。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/0d/awzsw326lctkoxrj7vj8i9ey8c7hxbb.mp3","text":"这是照相机，给你的礼物。谢谢你，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:3/37/c3alapc3v9mi46j0qtxyyd7ai8m3el5.mp3","text":"“正在播放音乐——《D.D.D.热门串烧》。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c9/sxgevb7fyqjg37s4kljmdaw0fp69bc5.mp3","text":"“摄影师稀音与摄影辅助机器人镜头，很高兴能认识你。”您好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/995knsn5fl025fzp4bp6jo7upgopkgs.mp3","text":"“请求重放，重复一遍，请求重放。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/nt50r72u5wbni9njt6nu3zucbirsiqs.mp3","text":"“配件已升级，稀音小姐向你表示感谢。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:5/51/essa1snb0qciyo7i3suv0v3f2qwxodk.mp3","text":"你也有想看的风景吗。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/69n1y0im24dquvy74venua78tzqd5wx.mp3","text":"“已获取队友数据。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/d14np7mwfahsrg47xglxekndumymyn7.mp3","text":"“已获取子数据。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4e/su97hnvzg3kykwq93tl700sjevczxk7.mp3","text":"“确认到出行讯号。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/8ul7mu7lr634jt42ieelfx6h98ujprs.mp3","text":"“已启动巡航程序。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/d0refahwvo7bqohpsxh42cyk5lv03ux.mp3","text":"“镜头为您效劳。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/j8p4w7ibwonu7nc9kbs7tnwcxbvu3fh.mp3","text":"在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/74/62fowp5wcar3iq6higwz8q361n2fhcn.mp3","text":"“开始摄像。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/nvgvx0nekj443g6cgiucvyuiz5zuowg.mp3","text":"嗯。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/1s139tfnavxtmzz98o1cuyzohlcqpia.mp3","text":"“拍摄——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/58/a0vlgpnbo9s2darozbzce6s8elffai8.mp3","text":"“曝光——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/schc7escr039sktxsla1zs6f77e38o0.mp3","text":"“全景——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/24/5q39lvtotzw8s5id0if0r9vsw7v1631.mp3","text":"“延时——”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/40/4czhyq0grtlniblb37bhqmunvuc5sup.mp3","text":"恭喜。","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/cpt92g7swwq3tbm6l8p2krmaxngig8m.mp3","text":"“任务完成，正在把稀音小姐运回基地。”","alt":"voice_cn/char_336_folivo/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/fw4irp7iss21q7sp7lrnq8tuj0dza49.mp3","text":"“回基地的路不太平坦呢。”","al